      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\"><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\">1。什么是差价合约指数交易？</span></span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t2cfdda3e3f2501fc",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">CFD index trading lets you trade the price movement of stock market indices without owning them. You earn based on the difference between entry and exit price.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/unlock-earning-opportunities-with-cfd-index-trading-in-uae#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/unlock-earning-opportunities-with-cfd-index-trading-in-uae"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">差价合约指数交易让您无需拥有股票市场指数即可交易它们的价格变动。您根据入场价和出场价之间的差额赚取收入。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t1c8698f8691956ea",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\"><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\">3. How can you start CFD Index Trading in the UAE?</span></span>",
      "kind": "html",
