        "SSR:/blogs/unlock-earning-opportunities-with-cfd-index-trading-in-uae"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\"><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\">9。阿联酋的场外交易是什么？</span></span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tbff3da453d355a57",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">OTC trading means you trade directly with a broker instead of using a central exchange. It is common for CFDs and forex.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/unlock-earning-opportunities-with-cfd-index-trading-in-uae#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/unlock-earning-opportunities-with-cfd-index-trading-in-uae"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">场外交易意味着您直接与经纪商进行交易，而不是使用中央交易所。这对于差价合约和外汇来说很常见。</span>"
    },
    {
