      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">了解外汇经纪商</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "td59b18c4909bdd2e",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">A forex broker acts as a bridge between traders and the global currency market. Brokers provide trading platforms, market access, liquidity, and tools that allow traders to buy and sell currency pairs.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/how-to-choose-the-best-forex-broker-in-middle-east-expert-guide#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/how-to-choose-the-best-forex-broker-in-middle-east-expert-guide"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">外汇经纪商充当交易者和全球货币市场之间的桥梁。经纪商提供交易平台、市场准入、流动性以及允许交易者买卖货币对的工具。</span>"
    },
