    {
      "key": "t2b7e242b113e7143",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Another important factor when choosing a forex broker is the cost of trading. Forex brokers earn revenue through spreads, commissions, and other service fees.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/how-to-choose-the-best-forex-broker-in-middle-east-expert-guide#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/how-to-choose-the-best-forex-broker-in-middle-east-expert-guide"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">选择外汇经纪商时的另一个重要因素是交易成本。外汇经纪商通过点差、佣金和其他服务费赚取收入。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t6f169407c4f8fee7",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">A spread is the difference between the buying price and selling price of a currency pair. Brokers that offer lower spreads can help traders maximize their profits.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/how-to-choose-the-best-forex-broker-in-middle-east-expert-guide#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/how-to-choose-the-best-forex-broker-in-middle-east-expert-guide"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">点差是货币对的买入价和卖出价之间的差额。提供较低点差的经纪商可以帮助交易者最大化利润。</span>"
    },
